From: Tiberiu Chibici <chibicitiberiu@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 18:40:38 +0300
Subject: track marks as arrays, only what the camera sees (ETR_GL_TRACKS)

DrawTrackmarks sent every quad of the track, up to 10000, as immediate mode calls, seen or not. The quads are kept in groups of 64 with a box each; only groups that touch the view frustum (without its far plane) go into one array, in the same order and with the same per-vertex colour, normal and texture coordinates. Strips are drawn as the separate quads they are, one draw for each run of the same texture.

